<title>FRANCE: LVMH -no immediate response to GrandMet.</title>
<headline>LVMH -no immediate response to GrandMet.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>LVMH Moet Hennessy Louis Vuitton had no immediate comment to a joint declaration by Grand Metropolitan and Guinness Plc that its proposal for a three-way drinks merger was &quot;fundamentally inequitable&quot;.</p>
<p>The British groups said in a statement that LVMH's plan, envisaging the de-mergers of their beer, fast food and canned foods activities, would result in substantial loss of value.</p>
<p>They said their plan to merge to create GMG Brands was on track, and the timetable would not be affected by LVMH's objections.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom, +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
